                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: Microsoft YaHei UI;font-size: 16.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为更有效落实浙江省政府2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">023</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年民生实事的工作要求，贯彻执行《推进山区</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">26</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">县和海岛县县域普通高中结对帮扶工作的实施方案》，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中与仙居中学在</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4月</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">开展了多项交流活动。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仙居中学派遣</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4位高考学科教学骨干赴我校跟岗锻炼。跟岗教师在我校全面参与上课、考务、教研等各项教学活动。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305040851582805.Jpeg" style="width: 4.027083in; height: 3.020139in" alt="202305040851582433.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305040851584555.Jpeg" style="width: 2.142361in; height: 1.606944in" alt="202305040851584146.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305040851584987.Jpeg" style="width: 1.868056in; height: 1.400694in" alt="202305040851583948.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2.我校选派管理干部担任仙居中学副校长，参与学校治理。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">4月27日、28日</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">副校长蒋明携</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三年级备课组长</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">前往仙居中学。仙居中学吴六昇书记代表学校对我校蒋明副校长一行的到来表示热烈欢迎。吴六昇书记介绍了仙居中学近百年的办学历程、学校发展中的优势和存在的问题，并表示仙居中学非常期待绍兴一中能发挥名校辐射引领作用，开展形式多样的结对帮扶活动，助力仙中教育教学水平提高和学校内涵建设的提升。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校蒋明副校长表示绍兴一中将以此次结对帮扶工作为契机，与仙居中学保持长期交流合作关系，致力于办好人民满意学校。蒋明副校长就学校办学理念传承发展提出自己的理解与建议，并表示绍兴一中将根据省厅有关结对帮扶工作要求，创造条件，积极统筹推进结对帮扶工作落实。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305040851583785.Png" style="width: 2.458333in; height: 2.395833in" alt="202305040851582496.Png" /></span><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305040851582815.Jpeg" style="width: 2.467361in; height: 2.275in" alt="202305040851580352.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仙居中学聘任我校教科室主任平建树为副校长，并为其颁发聘任书。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">随后我校与仙居中学就如何改进学校治理，提升县域高中质量进行了充分交流，并对后期双方如何进一步加强合作进行了初步规划。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2023\5\202305040851585292.Jpeg" style="width: 5.768055in; height: 4.326389in" alt="202305040851580314.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">3.开展课堂教学研讨和教学指导。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">仙居中学高三备课组精心准备了高考复习课。我校高三年级各学科备课组长深入课堂听课，在听课之后与授课教师进行了交流，结合新高考理念下的教学设计、思维提升、备考方向等提出指导性建议。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;">
</p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2023/5/202305040854179327.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202305040854179327.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2023/5/202305040854173861.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202305040854173861.png" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2023/5/202305040854179335.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202305040854179335.png" /></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">最后，两校高三备课组进行了分组教研交流。我校高三备课组长为仙居中学高三教师详细介绍了年级备课计划、教学方法、新高考应对策略等，并分享了在尖子生培养、临界生辅导方面的经验。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2023/5/202305040853226607.png" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202305040853226607.png" /></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">水本无华，相荡乃成涟漪；石本无火，互击而生灵光。愿风雨同舟，携手共进，同谱教育新篇章！</span></p>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
